**Check: Is Bloom returned only after all logs are fully processed?**

### Phase 2: Symbolic Execution

I performed symbolic execution over both `CreateBloom` and `MergeBloom` in `/home/gohan/ga-runners/actions-runner-security-agent-2/_work/security-agent/security-agent/target_workspace/core/types/bloom9.go` (lines 106-134).

